&lt;p&gt;Addepar is also building new tools to fulfill investors’ needs. From Big Data in Databricks to new web apps and everything in between, you’ll help us build an AI-first platform to empower investors. Moving forward, Navigator and these other tools will be used as the foundation to build key workflows that cater to large institutions, further integrating across the Addepar ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we continue to scale, a need has opened up for a Senior Software Engineer who would bring to bear their unique expertise with the existing Engineering team, with exciting opportunities to extend the scope for this role longer term, as the product continues to push onward into future global expansion mode.&lt;/p&gt;
