&lt;li&gt;Identify, document, and track bugs throughout their full lifecycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively participate in Agile/Scrum ceremonies and contribute to high-quality releases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share best practices and raise the QA bar across teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Preferred Experience&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3+ years of experience&lt;/strong&gt; in QA and test automation on complex systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong hands-on skills in &lt;strong&gt;Python&lt;/strong&gt; for automation (pytest, Locust, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with &lt;strong&gt;AI/ML systems&lt;/strong&gt; (model testing, data pipeline validation, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid expertise in &lt;strong&gt;CI/CD&lt;/strong&gt;: building, maintaining, and improving pipelines (GitLab CI or equivalent)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in &lt;strong&gt;API testing&lt;/strong&gt; (Postman, REST Assured, or similar)&lt;/li&gt;
