&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be part of our Fulfillment Product team. The current squad consists of &lt;strong&gt;7 people&lt;/strong&gt; based in Paris and Bordeaux. Together, you&#39;ll be shaping and delivering the core fulfillment experience for Mirakl&#39;s marketplace platform — from order routing to last-mile delivery innovation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role is a fixed-term position for 12 months (open to freelance), which requires to be based 4 days a week in our Paris or Bordeaux Office.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
