&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the roadmap and backlog for the Order &amp;amp; Dropship pillar end-to-end: prioritize ruthlessly, groom one quarter ahead, and maintain a clear 6-month roadmap with a 12-month innovation horizon ;&lt;/li&gt;
